name 'iterating-with-ai-preassessment-q10_2025'

question 'In programming, what does it mean to "mutate" data?'

wrong 'To create a copy of the data and change the copy.'
wrong 'To delete the data from the computer\'s memory.'
wrong 'To translate the data into a different programming language.'
right 'To change the original data structure directly.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 8

Mutation involves changing the original value or structure. In many apps, mutation is avoided (in favor of copying) to prevent unintended bugs in other parts of the program.
MARKDOWN
